  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "The pattern followed in the given series is:\n\n**(Third term - First term) + 10 = Second term**\n\nNow we apply the pattern on the given sets:\n\n(16, 22, 28)\n\n__**(28 - 16)**__ + 10 = 22\n\n__**12 + 10**__ = 22\n\n22 = 22\n\n(14, 19, 23)\n\n__(23 - 14)__ + 10 = 19\n\n__9 + 10__ = 19\n\n19 = 19\n\nNow we apply the pattern on the given options:\n\nOption 1) (12, 18, 25)\n\n__(25 - 12)__ + 10 = 18\n\n__13 + 10__ = 18\n\n23 ≠ 18\n\nOption 2) (13, 21, 27)\n\n__(27 - 13)__ + 10 = 21\n\n__14 + 10__ = 21\n\n24 ≠ 21\n\nOption 3) (15, 26, 31)\n\n__(31 - 15)__ + 10 = 26\n\n__16 + 10__ = 26\n\n26 = 26\n\nOption 4) (17, 24, 41)\n\n__(41 - 17)__ + 10 = 24\n\n__24 + 10__ = 24\n\n34 ≠ 24\n\nHence **the correct answer is option 3).**",
